        "title": "Log in with your Bosch account",
        "description": "Click **[this link]({auth_url})** to open the Bosch login page in a new browser tab and sign in with your Bosch account.\n\nAfter logging in, your browser will show a \"Cannot open page\" error — **that is expected**. Leave that tab open and click **Submit** below."
      },
      "pointtapi_oauth": {
        "title": "Complete sign-in",
        "description": "Paste the **callback URL** or just the **code** below. After you sign in, your browser jumps to an address starting with `com.bosch.tt.dashtt.pointt://app/login?code=` and usually shows a cannot-open-page or blank screen — that is expected. Copy the whole address, or only the value after `code=`.\n\n**Having trouble?** Some browsers don't show the URL clearly after login. Use the `run_playwright_ha.sh` helper script from the repository — it opens a browser, you log in once, and it prints the exact URL to paste here. See `POINTTAPI_OAUTH_TESTING.md` for instructions.",
        "data": {
          "oauth_callback_url": "Callback URL or code"
